WEBVTT

00:11:58.589 --> 00:12:00.674
that women of color
have different histories

00:12:00.674 --> 00:12:03.886
and different paths to get here,
and we recognize that.

00:12:04.303 --> 00:12:07.264
But we need to work together
to change the status quo.

00:12:08.432 --> 00:12:11.185
As we rise, we need
to take others with us.

00:12:11.852 --> 00:12:15.105
We have to do this together
and let go of the idea of one seat.

00:12:16.273 --> 00:12:18.567
This has to be a collective effort.

00:12:19.234 --> 00:12:22.946
We don't just want more power
in the same broken system,

00:12:22.946 --> 00:12:24.323
we want more.

00:12:25.073 --> 00:12:30.329
The last few years have served us
some sobering truths about the workplace.